      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I want to be able to control FOV, Aperture, focus distance and maybe even exposure. A 3D printed controller that i can mount my controller to with physical controls for this stuff would be so good for event photography can we please have this.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
