  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-11-04T09:58:52.548Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "we would like to be able to control he vrchat camera via OSC\n\nit would make the life of camera operators and VJs a lot easier if they could use a external controlpanel (TouchOSC for example)\n\nbeing able to togle streaming, spout and the layers at the minimum would help a lot.. \n\nposition and rotation control would be nice to have too\n\nphoography could probbly also benefit from being able to setup better defaults for all sorts of settings",
